        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾 Welcome to Animal Survival!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fast-paced, 3D casual roguelike RPG where the wild comes to life. Master the art of survival as you evolve your animal, craft powerful gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Clock:</strong> Hold your ground until the timer hits zero to clear the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve &amp; Gear Up:</strong> Defeat enemies to gather materials, level up, and craft superior equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Territory:</strong> Unlock new biomes and collect coins to permanently increase your strength.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺️ Explore &amp; Conquer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps:</strong> Journey through lush forests and harsh savannas, each with unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression:</strong> Use gathered resources to upgrade your character and unlock powerful new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Crafting:</strong> Turn your fallen foes into the tools you need to survive the next wave.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Competitive 1v1 PvP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena! Test your skills in high-stakes <strong>1v1 duels</strong>. Track your rivals using the mini-map, manage your respawns, and out-hunt the competition. In this mode, every animal defeated counts toward your victory—highest score takes the crown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Global Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be the Alpha? Compete against the world’s best survivors. Your progress is tracked across:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Maps Cleared</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highest Animal Levels Reached</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Tokens Earned</strong></p></li></ul>",
